-- The Marketing area's later tables (docs/marketing-plan.md §4.4–§4.6; docs/plan.md §1.73, the
-- wave's foundation): search figures (M45), content and the claims list (M46), the weekly report
-- (M47) and the forum watch (M48), in one migration so the wave's builders share one schema.
-- New tables only, so the previous Worker keeps working. Generated by drizzle-kit from
-- packs/marketing/src/schema.ts; the grants, row-level security, immutability triggers and pack
-- comments at the end are hand-written, as in 0037 and 0034.
--
--   search_source            One per client, site and provider (google, bing): its connection,
--                            how far the data runs, the last import, the last error in our words.
--   search_query_daily       A day's figures by query and page; an import replaces a day whole.
--   search_page_daily        A day's figures by page; the same.
--   content_page             A guide on a client's site: path fixed; status and live version only.
--   content_version          One version of a page (a person's or an agent's); insert only.
--   content_publish          Each publish and unpublish, who signed it, its external action.
--   content_redirect         An old path's redirect to a new one.
--   claims_version           A version of the client's claims list; insert only.
--   marketing_report         An agent's weekly report with its sources; only read_* change.
--   marketing_report_action  A report's suggested action, decided Done or Not now by a person.
--   forum_thread             A thread the forum watch saw (or a person pasted), once each.
--   forum_reply              A reply an agent drafted for a person to post by hand.
